ESP32C3 + PCM5102

ESP32-C3 GPIO4  ← AUDIO INPUT ADC *******
ESP32-C3 GPIO7  → PCM5102 BCK
ESP32-C3 GPIO9  → PCM5102 LCK / LRCK
ESP32-C3 GPIO10 → PCM5102 DIN
ESP32-C3 5V     → PCM5102 VIN
ESP32-C3 GND    → PCM5102 GND
PCM5102 SCK     → GND

*******
AUDIO INPUT ---- --GPIO4-----10K-----GND
3.3V------10K----GPIO4

VOLTAGE DIVISOR FROM 3.3V, 2X 10K RESISTORS, AND GPIO4 IN THE MIDLE, IS MANDATORY.
